// =============================================================================
// SOFA/ERFA Reference Values - Auto-generated
// =============================================================================
// Reference values from ERFA (the open-source edition of the IAU's SOFA
// library, the standard implementation of the Earth-rotation conventions),
// used by test_sofa_comprehensive.cpp. Generated by a Python script
// (sofa_comprehensive_validation.py, not included in this repository) that
// called ERFA version 2.0.1.5 at five epochs. Do not edit the values by hand.
// Angles are in radians; NPB = nutation-precession-bias matrix; Q, W = the
// GCRS->CIRS and polar-motion matrices; CIP / CIO / TIO = Celestial
// Intermediate Pole / Origin, Terrestrial Intermediate Origin; ERA = Earth
// Rotation Angle; GMST / GAST = Greenwich mean / apparent sidereal time.
// =============================================================================

#pragma once

